From: Navi
Subject: [PATCH] navi: non-motor tunnel access HardAvoid for ped/bike

Deny car-only tunnels for Pedestrian/Bicycle estimators (x1e6) unless
MWM types show yesfoot/yesbicycle, sidewalk, or footway/cycleway/path.
Also emit tunnel_ok on turns JSON for soft-avoid / counting.

---
